"value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T04:22:54-07:00","id":971872,"title":"","content":"So it makes your own Persona Yantra from Shadow Name more powerful if you take part in Rituals of your cabal, yes?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T04:30:15-07:00","id":971875,"title":"","content":"Doesn't seem to be limited to rituals though I guess it'd generally have to be in order to incorporate the yantra.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T04:49:50-07:00","id":971883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/971865-2e-cabals-themes-and-rituals?p=971872#post971872\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So it makes your own Persona Yantra from Shadow Name more powerful if you take part in Rituals of your cabal, yes?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It's for the use of the shadow name persona yantra in general. Basically a 4th dot of shadow name for all cabal members, making the symbols of the persona more powerful due to the shared theme of the whole cabal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6365-fumus","name":"Fumus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6365_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T07:39:15-07:00","id":971923,"title":"","content":"My new game group proposed Philosophers Stone as Theme - but we do not know how to reforge in to Cabal Theme for Rituals. Some one maybe have idea how to make it work?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T09:47:09-07:00","id":971976,"title":"","content":"How many members does the cabal have?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T09:54:21-07:00","id":971978,"title":"","content":"Official 3 members, with 1 Nameless that can come later on to join.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T10:11:03-07:00","id":971986,"title":"","content":"How hard can it be to build a persona that specializes in things that the Philosopher's Stone is purported to do? Perfection, transmutation, healing, immortality, etc. That's the kind of things the cabal would specialize in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T20:48:25-07:00","id":972315,"title":"","content":"They could use the Philosopher's Stones themselves as part of the yantra. Beyond that maybe they dress up as angels or wear jewelry and other accouterments made up of gold and lead, like a chain that begins with lead links but ends with gold ones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T22:28:00-07:00","id":972357,"title":"","content":"Take some advice from Sanctum &amp; Sigil: Sort out whatever the unifying symbol is and, more importantly, the unified interpretation. This can't just be loose; it's not enough for everyone to agree that the Philosopher's Stone is an important symbol, they also have to agree on what it <i>means</i>. While these need not be identical, there should be a central idea that unites them all; something that guides the cabal's purpose.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T00:16:29-07:00","id":972376,"title":"","content":"When thinking about Philosophers Stone as Cabal Theme, I think that <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magnum_opus_(alchemy)\" target=\"_blank\">stages of Magnum Opus</a> ( Stone creation ) could work, somehow. They are.<ul><li><i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nigredo\" target=\"_blank\">nigredo</a></i>, a blackening or melanosis</li> <li><i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albedo_(alchemy)\" target=\"_blank\">albedo</a></i>, a whitening or leucosis</li> <li><i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Citrinitas\" target=\"_blank\">citrinitas</a></i>, a yellowing or xanthosis</li> <li><i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rubedo\" target=\"_blank\">rubedo</a></i>, a reddening, purpling, or iosis</li> </ul>Could work something like this as Theme? And then Rituals would be like Nigredo member passing power to Albedo one, yes?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-19-2016, 03:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T02:01:40-07:00","id":972408,"title":"","content":"Sure, whatever.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}